{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"289","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Polo the Penguin and Segments "}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little penguin Polo adores integer segments, that is, pairs of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l; r]"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(l ≤ r)"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He has a set that consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer segments: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l1; r1], [l2; r2], ..., [ln; rn]"},{"kind":"text","text":". We know that no two segments of this set intersect. In one move Polo can either widen any segment of the set 1 unit to the left or 1 unit to the right, that is transform "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l; r]"},{"kind":"text","text":" to either segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l - 1; r]"},{"kind":"text","text":", or to segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l; r + 1]"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"value"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a set of segments that consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" segments "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l1; r1], [l2; r2], ..., [ln; rn]"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that there is integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":", for which the following inequality holds, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj ≤ x ≤ rj"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum number of moves needed to make the value of the set of Polo's segments divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, k ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Each of the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain a segment as a pair of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 105 ≤ li ≤ ri ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"), separated by a space."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no two segments intersect. In other words, for any two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i, j"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ i < j ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" the following inequality holds, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"min(ri, rj) < max(li, lj)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In a single line print a single integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3\n1 2\n3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 7\n1 2\n3 3\n4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"289A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/289/problem/A"}